stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Discovered
    Discovered --> Verified: 签名依赖授权校验
    Verified --> Staged: 预检迁移/资源隔离
    Staged --> Ready: Schema 与动作快照验证
    Ready --> Active: 激活发布代际
    Active --> Draining: 管理员停用/授权撤销
    Draining --> Disabled: 在途完成或持久检查点
    Staged --> Failed: 检查失败
    Ready --> Failed: 发布失败
    Active --> Failed: 隔离运行故障
    Failed --> Disabled: 安全停用
    Disabled --> [*]
